    "caption": "🇰🇿As part of Kazakhstan Tech Solution Day, we hosted a dynamic panel session on “Human Capital in the Digital Age: Key Challenges and Management Strategies.” Leading voices in education and technology came together to discuss how digital transformation is reshaping the workforce.\n\n🔥Participants:\n\nSayasat Nurbek, Minister of Science and Higher Education of Kazakhstan\nNicolas Sadirac, Co-founder of 01 Edu and 01 Talent\nDmitry Gaudur, CEO of Lerna\nAsem Tazhieva, CEO and Founder of Ozim\nMiras Daulenov, President of Coventry University in Kazakhstan\n\n🙏A big thank you to our panelists for their insights and for driving the conversation on how to navigate the challenges of the digital era!",
